WEBVTT

01:30.590 --> 01:34.870
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.210 --> 01:37.780
[Episode 21]

01:51.870 --> 01:53.470
If your heart is not sincere,

01:54.120 --> 01:55.350
your life will end.

01:57.150 --> 01:59.000
But Exalted Immortal...

02:04.640 --> 02:06.570
Without destiny for immortality,

02:06.790 --> 02:08.720
it'll all just be a fleeting dream.

02:09.630 --> 02:12.030
Even the Exalted Immortal cannot save you.

02:12.310 --> 02:13.800
Why is that?

02:14.840 --> 02:17.110
Those hundred maidens sent last time

02:17.470 --> 02:19.000
had too much selfish desire

02:19.150 --> 02:21.150
and too many distracting thoughts,

02:21.190 --> 02:23.390
making you unworthy of the Yuli Spring.

02:25.190 --> 02:26.720
Please, Exalted Immortal,

02:27.680 --> 02:28.540
do not be angry.

02:29.070 --> 02:31.310
Since ancient times,
human hearts are hard to fathom.

02:31.310 --> 02:33.680
If any wretched servant
has offended Exalted Immortal,

02:33.680 --> 02:35.280
I will punish them severely.

02:36.120 --> 02:38.250
But everyone in the Tiansheng Dynasty

02:38.610 --> 02:41.130
has been sincere to Exalted Immortal—

02:41.560 --> 02:43.290
the heavens can be the witness.

02:54.150 --> 02:56.079
If you claim your heart is sincere,

02:59.280 --> 03:01.310
then cut it out and show it to me.

03:03.080 --> 03:06.280
Didn't you believe that by drinking
from the Yuli Spring,

03:06.520 --> 03:08.720
you had already achieved immortality?

03:09.470 --> 03:11.870
If what you drank
was truly the Yuli Spring,

03:13.710 --> 03:15.030
you wouldn't die.

03:16.340 --> 03:17.640
Shall we test it?

03:28.079 --> 03:29.150
I was foolish.

03:31.870 --> 03:33.630
Please, Exalted Immortal,
give me another chance.

03:33.630 --> 03:35.630
I will surely show Exalted Immortal

03:35.750 --> 03:37.190
my sincerity.

03:41.000 --> 03:42.660
Though you've made a mistake,

03:43.520 --> 03:45.980
there is someone
truly sincere by your side.

03:46.400 --> 03:48.800
He is the key to finding the Yuli Spring.

03:50.320 --> 03:52.579
Please enlighten me, Exalted Immortal.

03:53.310 --> 03:54.870
Bingzhu of the Feiyu Guard

03:55.750 --> 03:57.280
is worthy of great purpose.

04:05.280 --> 04:06.470
Where is Bingzhu?

04:07.630 --> 04:08.710
Your Majesty,

04:09.120 --> 04:11.720
Bingzhu is imprisoned
in the Imperial Prison,

04:12.240 --> 04:15.800
awaiting execution
at noon as you commanded.

04:15.800 --> 04:17.310
No!

04:20.390 --> 04:20.920
My Lord,

04:21.420 --> 04:22.810
it's already past 9 a.m.

04:23.000 --> 04:26.060
We should escort the prisoner
to the Meridian Gate now.

04:26.280 --> 04:28.340
Haven't you found that demoness yet?

04:32.720 --> 04:33.159
No.

04:34.230 --> 04:36.230
We cannot allow any complications.

04:37.510 --> 04:39.170
Let's just deal with him here.

04:39.800 --> 04:40.750
Here?

04:41.250 --> 04:42.100
I'm afraid

04:42.190 --> 04:43.720
this goes against His Majesty's wishes,
My Lord.

04:43.720 --> 04:44.980
His Majesty's wishes?

04:45.480 --> 04:46.580
His Majesty's wishes are unfathomable.

04:46.580 --> 04:48.720
What's the point
of following so many imperial edicts?

04:48.720 --> 04:49.800
I spoke out of turn.

04:50.040 --> 04:51.270
Forgive my impertinence.

04:51.270 --> 04:53.000
It's all up to My Lord to decide.

04:54.750 --> 04:56.350
What His Majesty wants to see

04:56.550 --> 04:57.390
is Bingzhu

04:57.630 --> 04:59.550
beheaded in front of everyone.

05:02.680 --> 05:05.340
But Lord Bingzhu
has drunk from the Yuli Spring.

05:06.340 --> 05:07.400
I fear beheading alone

05:07.400 --> 05:09.660
won't eliminate the root of the problem.

05:10.690 --> 05:13.490
That would truly go against
His Majesty's wishes.

05:17.190 --> 05:18.850
Go fetch some mulberry paper.

05:19.130 --> 05:20.790
Let's suffocate Lord Bingzhu

05:21.240 --> 05:22.350
to death.

05:23.040 --> 05:23.510
Yes.

05:35.050 --> 05:36.480
A promotion to a first-class official

05:36.480 --> 05:39.080
makes you worry-free
about food and clothing.

05:53.360 --> 05:54.860
With new titles bestowed,

05:55.430 --> 05:57.030
may it be an auspicious omen!

05:59.280 --> 06:00.210
Put another one.

06:25.160 --> 06:27.230
The imperial edict has arrived!

06:31.430 --> 06:32.980
By the mandate of heaven,

06:33.270 --> 06:34.750
the Emperor decrees:

06:35.630 --> 06:37.510
in consideration of

06:37.510 --> 06:39.950
the many loyal years of service
of the accused,

06:39.950 --> 06:41.610
Bingzhu of the Feiyu Guard,

06:42.070 --> 06:44.240
who devoted himself to slaying demons,

06:44.240 --> 06:46.830
I wish for peace throughout the land,

06:47.510 --> 06:49.600
and hope for his sincere repentance.

06:50.510 --> 06:54.570
I hereby pardon Bingzhu and summon him
to the West Garden for an audience.

06:55.270 --> 06:57.070
So it is decreed.

06:59.840 --> 07:02.300
I, your humble subject,
receive this edict.

07:29.960 --> 07:31.120
Lord Bingzhu,

07:31.640 --> 07:33.040
your palanquin is ready.

07:33.360 --> 07:34.650
Please come this way.

08:24.920 --> 08:26.520
As long as the heart remains,

08:28.560 --> 08:30.160
nightmares can still occur.

08:34.200 --> 08:35.440
From now on,

08:38.230 --> 08:41.830
at least no one can use
nightmare techniques against me anymore.

08:43.500 --> 08:45.160
Your brother will be safe now.

08:49.940 --> 08:51.280
I have become a spirit.

08:54.270 --> 08:55.670
Sooner or later,

08:58.290 --> 09:00.010
you will kill me too—

09:03.440 --> 09:06.130
just as you slaughter other demons.

09:12.070 --> 09:16.400
There are too many things in this world
that need to be judged as right or wrong.

09:20.970 --> 09:23.630
But the rights and wrongs
that don't concern me,

09:26.330 --> 09:28.610
I no longer wish to argue about.

09:29.910 --> 09:32.570
I will only care
about the three of us from now on.

09:34.230 --> 09:35.500
How's that?

10:10.510 --> 10:12.810
My Lord always knows what's best.

10:13.390 --> 10:14.170
What's best?

10:14.510 --> 10:15.440
This, of course!

10:15.750 --> 10:18.090
I told Xiao Yao and Dali before

10:18.270 --> 10:20.200
that rolling in the mud feels wonderful,

10:20.200 --> 10:21.730
but they didn't believe me.

10:23.630 --> 10:24.610
What did you say, My Lord?

10:24.610 --> 10:25.390
Did you get the directions?

10:25.390 --> 10:26.000
Yes, I did.

10:26.200 --> 10:28.360
We're still hundreds of miles
from Mount Qingyuan.

10:28.360 --> 10:29.690
Then let's keep moving.

10:30.120 --> 10:30.720
My Lord,

10:30.870 --> 10:32.790
the shopkeeper thought I was cute

10:32.840 --> 10:34.510
and gave me a freshly steamed bun.

10:34.510 --> 10:35.360
Would you like half?

10:35.360 --> 10:35.850
No.

10:35.960 --> 10:36.690
Walk faster.

10:38.270 --> 10:39.970
Are we in such a hurry?

10:40.870 --> 10:42.270
It's to make you stronger

10:42.290 --> 10:44.840
so you won't end up
as someone else's bun filling.

10:44.840 --> 10:46.640
How thoughtful you are, My Lord.

10:58.600 --> 10:59.310
My Lord,

10:59.720 --> 11:01.530
are we still going on foot?

11:02.740 --> 11:03.390
What else?

11:04.840 --> 11:07.060
If you could conjure some silver,

11:07.090 --> 11:08.460
we could buy a carriage

11:08.670 --> 11:09.640
and walk less.

11:10.270 --> 11:11.630
The shopkeeper just now also said

11:11.630 --> 11:14.360
taking the water route
is actually the fastest way.

11:14.360 --> 11:16.020
Why didn't you say so earlier?

11:16.800 --> 11:18.460
I just remembered it.

11:19.900 --> 11:22.430
I shouldn't have let
a pig ask for directions.

11:33.720 --> 11:34.270
My Lord.

11:34.440 --> 11:35.030
I just finished eating,

11:35.030 --> 11:36.120
but I feel hungry again.

11:36.120 --> 11:36.600
Can I—

11:36.600 --> 11:37.210
Watch out!

11:38.440 --> 11:39.500
-Luoluo!
-My Lord!

11:40.240 --> 11:41.570
Save me!

11:50.000 --> 11:51.150
In broad daylight,

11:51.150 --> 11:53.420
strolling through Black Wind Fortress
like this—

11:53.420 --> 11:55.350
do you think we're all fast asleep?

11:56.510 --> 11:57.580
What do you want?

11:57.870 --> 11:58.400
Leave...

11:59.000 --> 12:00.260
Leave some toll money.

12:03.250 --> 12:05.280
You dare to rob me?

12:05.390 --> 12:07.520
Have you really thought this through?

12:09.450 --> 12:10.020
Boss.

12:11.650 --> 12:12.510
I don't know what

12:12.510 --> 12:13.900
this guy is up to.

12:14.200 --> 12:15.510
Let's all attack together,

12:15.510 --> 12:16.830
cut him into pieces,

12:16.860 --> 12:17.920
and be done with it.

12:20.640 --> 12:22.030
He's just a weak scholar,

12:22.030 --> 12:23.290
and you're all scared?

12:26.150 --> 12:26.870
Step back.

12:28.220 --> 12:29.750
Let me handle him.

12:31.270 --> 12:34.000
If we kill him,
how can we sell him for a good price?

12:35.200 --> 12:36.400
I am a merchant's son.

12:37.240 --> 12:39.310
The one you've captured
is my personal attendant.

12:39.310 --> 12:41.770
I was passing through
with a family treasure

12:41.820 --> 12:43.670
when I unfortunately
got separated from my family.

12:43.670 --> 12:45.320
If you release my attendant,

12:47.110 --> 12:47.920
this treasure

12:48.440 --> 12:49.600
will be yours.

13:12.910 --> 13:13.720
No, no!

13:14.120 --> 13:15.310
I was wrong!

13:15.550 --> 13:16.580
I'm not fighting anymore!

13:16.580 --> 13:17.200
I'm sorry!

13:17.480 --> 13:18.720
-Release him!
-I'm sorry.

13:18.720 --> 13:19.710
Release him! Release him!

13:19.710 --> 13:20.440
Release him.

13:30.880 --> 13:31.410
Get lost.

13:32.900 --> 13:34.490
My Lord, you're amazing!

13:35.390 --> 13:35.870
Luoluo,

13:36.360 --> 13:36.840
are you alright?

13:36.840 --> 13:37.480
I'm fine.

13:37.870 --> 13:38.390
My Lord,

13:38.510 --> 13:40.960
why didn't you
just use your power to fight them

13:40.960 --> 13:42.620
instead of making up stories?

13:42.790 --> 13:43.590
Among humans,

13:43.930 --> 13:45.530
we should use human methods.

13:45.670 --> 13:46.840
We should adapt to our surroundings.

13:46.840 --> 13:47.240
Hong Ye!

13:47.240 --> 13:48.240
That makes sense.

13:48.270 --> 13:49.020
Luoluo!

13:50.120 --> 13:50.750
Xiao Yao?

13:51.360 --> 13:52.390
Where are you going?

13:52.390 --> 13:53.720
Back to Demons' Valley.

13:54.440 --> 13:56.240
Are you done with your business?

14:01.450 --> 14:04.050
You're leaving
without saying goodbye again.

14:10.140 --> 14:11.080
In my current state,

14:11.080 --> 14:12.740
I can't protect you properly.

14:13.210 --> 14:14.740
This trip to Demons' Valley

14:14.790 --> 14:16.450
will be extremely dangerous.

14:16.870 --> 14:18.930
I don't even know if I'll return alive

14:19.030 --> 14:21.090
or be able to stand by your side again.

14:21.440 --> 14:22.520
If you come with me,

14:22.540 --> 14:24.470
it will only bring you more danger.

14:26.000 --> 14:28.240
So you just left me there alone?

14:28.240 --> 14:29.700
I never wanted to leave you

14:30.440 --> 14:31.300
or abandon you.

14:33.330 --> 14:34.420
I only want to find

14:36.070 --> 14:37.850
a safe place for you.

14:38.720 --> 14:39.960
So I made a decision of my own accord.

14:39.960 --> 14:42.310
Yes—of your own accord!

14:43.670 --> 14:45.200
That's only what you think!

14:45.200 --> 14:46.390
Do you know what I think?

14:46.390 --> 14:47.360
Did you ever ask me?

14:47.360 --> 14:50.620
You don't have the right to decide
whether I'll stay or not!

14:52.790 --> 14:53.670
We've been

14:53.670 --> 14:55.320
through life and death together.

14:55.320 --> 14:56.520
What's there to fear?

14:59.320 --> 15:00.920
Hong Ye, I'm asking you once.

15:01.750 --> 15:02.480
In this life,

15:03.550 --> 15:05.750
shall we never see each other ever again

15:07.000 --> 15:09.130
or go through thick and thin together,

15:09.200 --> 15:10.800
moving forward hand in hand—

15:12.660 --> 15:13.660
make your choice.

15:37.030 --> 15:38.150
For me,

15:38.970 --> 15:40.900
my answer has always been only you.

15:45.510 --> 15:46.040
Let's go,

15:46.100 --> 15:47.430
back to Demons' Valley.

15:54.660 --> 15:56.320
This is what you chose, right?

16:01.320 --> 16:02.850
I wish for your heart alone,

16:03.310 --> 16:05.640
and to never part
until we're old and gray.

16:28.200 --> 16:30.060
I, your guilty subject, Bingzhu,

16:32.110 --> 16:33.770
pay respects to Your Majesty.

16:43.230 --> 16:44.040
Rise.

16:45.440 --> 16:46.240
Be seated.

16:46.990 --> 16:48.480
Thank you, Your Majesty.

16:56.440 --> 16:57.900
My dear minister,

16:58.120 --> 17:00.650
do you still resent me?

17:01.930 --> 17:03.060
This guilty subject

17:05.109 --> 17:06.589
would never dare.

17:13.740 --> 17:16.599
I have always valued talent.

17:20.200 --> 17:21.640
Otherwise, the court

17:21.640 --> 17:23.960
would not have loyal ministers like you

17:23.960 --> 17:26.089
who come from humble origins.

17:27.750 --> 17:28.920
However,

17:30.100 --> 17:33.500
the position of Feiyu Guard Demon Slayer
is no ordinary role.

17:35.860 --> 17:39.780
On a smaller scale,
it concerns my personal safety.

17:40.240 --> 17:44.620
On a larger scale, it bears
the responsibility for all people's lives.

17:45.160 --> 17:46.200
I had to be

17:48.380 --> 17:50.180
extremely cautious.

17:51.310 --> 17:52.640
Do you understand?

17:53.550 --> 17:54.840
This guilty subject

17:55.750 --> 17:57.170
understands.

17:59.000 --> 18:00.240
I have investigated.

18:02.510 --> 18:03.890
This sea voyage,

18:05.350 --> 18:07.150
although it failed to locate Yuli Spring,

18:07.150 --> 18:07.910
the fault

18:08.440 --> 18:10.570
was not yours.

18:11.790 --> 18:13.310
As the Emperor,

18:13.310 --> 18:15.370
I have the wisdom to judge character.

18:16.200 --> 18:18.130
Sending you to the Imperial Prison

18:19.170 --> 18:22.310
was your final test.

18:24.180 --> 18:26.080
The Yuli Spring is crucial to the empire.

18:26.080 --> 18:29.010
I need someone like you
who can withstand such trials

18:30.940 --> 18:33.390
for me to feel at ease.

18:35.400 --> 18:36.920
As of today,

18:37.110 --> 18:39.210
I have no more doubts about you.

18:40.550 --> 18:42.030
You need not address yourself

18:42.030 --> 18:44.030
as "guilty subject" anymore.

18:46.300 --> 18:49.250
Considering your years of loyal service

18:49.550 --> 18:51.010
and excellent character,

18:52.030 --> 18:54.530
I hereby name you Bulwark Duke.

18:56.060 --> 19:00.190
In accordance with your noble rank,
I'll reward you with 100 acres of land,

19:00.240 --> 19:01.970
and a thousand stones of grain.

19:03.790 --> 19:04.920
How does that sound?

19:07.510 --> 19:08.400
I

19:09.030 --> 19:10.720
thank Your Majesty
for your generous grace.

19:10.720 --> 19:12.680
Long live

19:12.920 --> 19:14.030
Your Majesty!

19:14.030 --> 19:15.590
Whether I can live long or not depends on

19:15.590 --> 19:17.790
if you find the Yuli Spring or not.

19:19.030 --> 19:20.280
Come.

19:20.640 --> 19:22.300
Tell me everything in detail.

19:26.030 --> 19:27.960
When you met the Exalted Immortal,

19:31.110 --> 19:32.550
what did you talk about?

19:34.390 --> 19:36.590
What does the Exalted Immortal prefer?

19:38.350 --> 19:39.480
Your Majesty,

19:40.000 --> 19:40.640
I

19:42.790 --> 19:45.050
have only met the Exalted Immortal once.

19:45.910 --> 19:47.910
The rules on the island were strict.

19:48.280 --> 19:50.480
I was not allowed to move around freely.

19:50.920 --> 19:51.590
So I

19:53.070 --> 19:54.440
don't know the details.

20:03.830 --> 20:05.350
Enough.

20:09.550 --> 20:10.990
It's useless

20:11.110 --> 20:13.550
to talk about the past now.

20:17.640 --> 20:20.040
Since you are favored
by Exalted Immortal,

20:20.490 --> 20:23.420
you should quickly find a way
to ask Exalted Immortal

20:24.030 --> 20:25.550
what else I need to do

20:25.550 --> 20:28.640
to be granted the Yuli Spring.

20:39.680 --> 20:40.400
I

20:41.720 --> 20:43.590
dare ask Your Majesty,

20:44.270 --> 20:46.270
is the Exalted Immortal you speak of

20:47.590 --> 20:49.720
still the one in this painting?

20:57.000 --> 20:58.200
The Exalted Immortal

20:58.670 --> 21:00.230
has many incarnations.

21:00.480 --> 21:03.480
As long as she is still willing
to reveal herself to me,

21:04.130 --> 21:06.540
immortality is still possible.

21:20.020 --> 21:21.330
[Residence of the Bulwark Duke]

21:25.930 --> 21:29.220
[Distinguish right from wrong]

21:26.550 --> 21:29.170
Welcome home, Bulwark Duke.

21:35.400 --> 21:36.030
My Lord!

21:36.690 --> 21:38.530
I know my crime is unforgivable,

21:39.030 --> 21:40.190
but considering our many years

21:40.190 --> 21:41.920
of fighting side by side,

21:42.110 --> 21:44.150
I beg for your mercy, My Lord.

21:49.160 --> 21:49.910
My Lord.

21:50.530 --> 21:52.130
I know I cannot escape death.

21:52.900 --> 21:54.330
I have failed you.

21:55.000 --> 21:56.090
Whether you kill me or not,

21:56.090 --> 21:57.550
I submit to your judgment.

22:09.030 --> 22:10.280
But I want to say,

22:12.680 --> 22:14.210
those who wanted to kill you

22:14.520 --> 22:16.630
were never us brothers,

22:18.000 --> 22:19.570
but the imperial edict!

22:25.480 --> 22:26.410
Please, My Lord,

22:26.640 --> 22:29.240
don't make things difficult
for the brothers.

22:29.540 --> 22:32.160
Everyone joined the Feiyu Guard—
a job so tough—

22:32.160 --> 22:33.890
all for the sake of their families.

22:33.890 --> 22:35.030
We're all risking our lives

22:35.030 --> 22:36.430
in exchange for a salary.

22:36.610 --> 22:38.440
If they have offended you in any way,

22:38.440 --> 22:40.300
they were only following orders.

22:40.960 --> 22:42.290
If you have grievances,

22:42.790 --> 22:44.590
direct them at me, Ji Yan, alone.

22:46.160 --> 22:47.920
The brothers have a hard life.

22:49.440 --> 22:51.150
I beg for your forgiveness.

23:09.040 --> 23:10.100
If that's the case,

23:11.030 --> 23:11.750
I, Ji Yan,

23:13.550 --> 23:15.210
am willing to cut off my own hand

23:15.210 --> 23:16.350
to appease My Lord.

23:24.230 --> 23:26.090
I submit myself to your judgment!

23:35.110 --> 23:36.510
Everyone, get up.

23:43.070 --> 23:43.960
Get up!

23:54.440 --> 23:55.920
When did you

23:56.350 --> 23:58.420
start colluding with the demons?

23:59.670 --> 24:01.770
What kind of deals have you made?

24:02.550 --> 24:04.440
Tell me everything in detail.

24:06.830 --> 24:08.960
If you hide even the slightest detail,

24:11.200 --> 24:12.540
I will show no mercy.

24:18.310 --> 24:20.570
Thank you for sparing our lives, My Lord.

24:23.140 --> 24:29.770
[Distinguish right from wrong]

24:24.790 --> 24:26.720
My first encounter with the demons

24:27.240 --> 24:28.270
began after Miss Xiao Yao

24:28.270 --> 24:30.600
was captured and taken to Demons' Valley.

24:31.920 --> 24:35.070
Back then, you had just been appointed
as the Demon Slayer of the Feiyu Guard

24:35.070 --> 24:36.530
and posted bounty notices

24:36.750 --> 24:38.350
to lure out the great demons.

24:39.710 --> 24:40.910
That very night,

24:41.430 --> 24:43.360
a demon calling himself Heiwu

24:44.000 --> 24:45.200
approached me.

24:46.250 --> 24:48.110
He offered to help the Feiyu Guard

24:48.200 --> 24:50.060
eliminate the Demon King Hong Ye.

24:55.400 --> 24:57.930
Now, on the first and fifteenth
of each month,

24:58.200 --> 24:58.800
the demons

24:58.990 --> 25:00.610
offer up some minor demons.

25:01.070 --> 25:02.110
We escort them to
the Elixir Refining Chamber

25:02.110 --> 25:04.170
in the West Garden to create elixirs.

25:04.310 --> 25:05.570
With this arrangement,

25:05.570 --> 25:08.020
we also earn rewards for our brothers

25:09.370 --> 25:10.770
to support our families.

25:13.770 --> 25:15.350
I never imagined

25:17.640 --> 25:21.350
the Feiyu Guard has fallen so low.

25:23.400 --> 25:24.030
My Lord!

25:25.100 --> 25:26.500
Forgive my boldness.

25:29.390 --> 25:32.150
But what we have between
the Feiyu Guard and the demons

25:32.150 --> 25:33.910
is already the best we can have.

25:41.510 --> 25:43.070
What are you talking about?

25:44.920 --> 25:45.980
Only when soldiers

25:46.160 --> 25:48.160
don't eliminate bandits completely,

25:48.160 --> 25:50.160
will the court keep the soldiers employed.

25:50.160 --> 25:50.680
My Lord.

25:51.370 --> 25:53.830
Demons can never be completely eliminated.

25:53.960 --> 25:55.240
The current arrangement,

25:55.240 --> 25:57.310
where demons provide
some insignificant minor demons

25:57.310 --> 25:58.310
for the Feiyu Guard to report as captures—

25:58.310 --> 25:59.970
isn't this the best solution?

26:01.160 --> 26:01.890
Besides you,

26:02.400 --> 26:05.200
no one wants
the demons completely exterminated.

26:06.550 --> 26:08.550
Since you became the Demon Slayer,

26:08.930 --> 26:10.790
you've pushed everyone too hard.

26:12.270 --> 26:13.310
Each of us

26:13.830 --> 26:15.960
risks our lives day and night

26:16.310 --> 26:18.170
without receiving any benefits.

26:19.000 --> 26:20.030
We had no choice

26:21.440 --> 26:24.040
but to join forces
with the demons against you.

26:24.740 --> 26:25.350
My Lord,

26:26.720 --> 26:28.650
the feud between humans and demons

26:28.830 --> 26:31.000
ultimately means less than the lives

26:31.000 --> 26:32.200
of our families.

26:33.070 --> 26:35.350
We just want to protect those close to us.

26:37.920 --> 26:39.380
If everyone were like you,

26:40.140 --> 26:41.700
saving the world

26:43.310 --> 26:45.970
while suffering
the tragic deaths of loved ones

26:46.030 --> 26:48.690
and the torment
of souls unable to reincarnate,

26:49.580 --> 26:51.010
what would be the point?

26:56.660 --> 26:58.720
Even if all these brothers were gone,

27:00.000 --> 27:01.530
and replaced with new ones,

27:02.240 --> 27:04.270
the result would be the same.

27:12.680 --> 27:13.310
I speak

27:13.820 --> 27:15.390
from the bottom of my heart.

27:15.590 --> 27:17.190
Please reconsider, My Lord!

27:17.480 --> 27:19.310
Please reconsider, My Lord!

27:19.400 --> 27:21.220
Please reconsider, My Lord!

27:21.270 --> 27:22.870
Please reconsider, My Lord!

27:22.960 --> 27:24.640
Please reconsider, My Lord!

27:44.510 --> 27:45.400
Last night,

27:47.110 --> 27:49.270
that woman who fought with you,

27:50.240 --> 27:51.960
has she appeared again?

27:54.150 --> 27:56.030
The Feiyu Guard and Imperial Guards

27:56.030 --> 27:59.090
have searched the entire city
but found no trace of her.

27:59.200 --> 28:01.440
However, that woman
has exceptional martial arts skills,

28:01.440 --> 28:02.790
and she has
the demon-slaying blade with her.

28:02.790 --> 28:03.960
She should be fine.

28:34.680 --> 28:35.920
When you recover your power,

28:35.920 --> 28:38.520
you must conjure
lots and lots of silver for me.

28:39.440 --> 28:40.310
Okay.

28:40.750 --> 28:42.550
I'll give you anything you want.

28:49.920 --> 28:50.810
Xiao Yao.

28:51.480 --> 28:53.000
I want to ask you something.

28:53.000 --> 28:53.960
Yes, go ahead.

28:56.000 --> 28:56.900
Dali...

28:58.160 --> 28:59.790
is not coming back, is she?

29:06.880 --> 29:08.740
You've been avoiding the subject

29:09.240 --> 29:10.770
and I've been afraid to ask.

29:12.210 --> 29:14.410
But the closer we get to Demons' Valley,

29:14.960 --> 29:16.420
the more I think about her.

29:19.710 --> 29:20.540
Dali...

29:22.310 --> 29:25.510
has become the most beautiful flower
among all blossoms.

29:27.460 --> 29:28.400
That's good.

29:29.800 --> 29:31.200
She always loved beauty.

29:33.640 --> 29:35.840
Dali has gone far away for cultivation.

29:37.070 --> 29:39.590
I'm sure we'll see her again someday.

29:40.310 --> 29:40.750
Yes.

30:13.920 --> 30:14.400
My Lord,

30:14.720 --> 30:15.720
are you all right?

30:18.110 --> 30:19.440
I suddenly feel uneasy.

30:19.550 --> 30:21.480
I just need to rest here for a while.

30:21.720 --> 30:22.650
You all go ahead.

30:22.850 --> 30:23.310
Yes, sir.

30:23.310 --> 30:23.830
Yes.

31:04.550 --> 31:05.750
If one is not a spirit,

31:06.700 --> 31:08.430
can they still use spirit arts?

31:12.510 --> 31:13.200
No.

31:15.280 --> 31:18.540
You've been carrying the Exquisite Heart
you brought back

31:19.790 --> 31:21.520
from the Realm of Mist and Void.

31:31.240 --> 31:32.170
It's right here.

31:41.560 --> 31:43.610
I was so arrogant.

31:47.720 --> 31:49.790
I kept saying I would take care of you.

31:50.990 --> 31:53.000
But in the end, because of me,

31:54.170 --> 31:56.610
you've taken the same path as Lu Tong.

31:57.360 --> 31:58.550
I, Bingzhu,

31:59.890 --> 32:02.890
carry the empty title of demon slayer,

32:06.100 --> 32:08.230
but in the end, I couldn't save anyone.

32:10.350 --> 32:11.610
What's wrong with you?

32:14.500 --> 32:16.160
Why do I still feel heartache?

32:18.110 --> 32:20.970
Wasn't replacing
my heart with the Exquisite Heart

32:21.830 --> 32:23.880
supposed to make me feel nothing?

32:28.590 --> 32:30.520
You were originally a kind person.

32:32.020 --> 32:33.750
Even if you changed your heart,

32:34.110 --> 32:35.240
it wouldn't change who you are.

32:35.240 --> 32:35.830
No!

32:38.400 --> 32:39.400
I am a demon,

32:41.040 --> 32:42.050
a spirit...

32:43.880 --> 32:46.920
I used spirit arts to bewitch people.

32:46.920 --> 32:48.440
Humans can be good or bad—

32:48.440 --> 32:50.300
same goes for spirits and demons.

32:51.510 --> 32:53.570
What corrupts both humans and demons

32:53.750 --> 32:54.980
is desire.

33:05.570 --> 33:07.960
Half of my life has been in vain.

33:11.030 --> 33:13.920
I no longer care about
right or wrong in this world.

33:16.830 --> 33:18.070
My only wish is

33:19.750 --> 33:20.720
for the day when we

33:20.720 --> 33:22.920
stand against each other
to never come.

33:27.690 --> 33:29.250
If that moment truly comes,

33:32.040 --> 33:32.720
I beg you...

33:37.460 --> 33:38.510
Promise me,

33:40.270 --> 33:41.270
will you?

33:49.030 --> 33:50.070
Promise me,

33:53.030 --> 33:54.030
please?

34:01.260 --> 34:03.240
A-Aren't we going back to Demons' Valley?

34:03.240 --> 34:04.460
Where is this place?

34:04.920 --> 34:06.070
The barrier at the riverbank

34:06.070 --> 34:07.530
must have been destroyed.

34:08.150 --> 34:10.440
There will certainly be
many Feiyu Guards stationed there.

34:10.440 --> 34:11.440
I once set

34:11.800 --> 34:13.230
a hidden barrier here

34:13.590 --> 34:14.719
that only I can open.

34:15.639 --> 34:16.679
I thought

34:17.150 --> 34:18.480
I'd never need to use it.

34:19.760 --> 34:21.670
My Lord, your foresight is formidable.

34:21.670 --> 34:22.360
In that case,

34:22.360 --> 34:23.320
we can rush in

34:23.320 --> 34:24.480
and kill them all,

34:24.480 --> 34:25.190
catching them off guard.

34:25.190 --> 34:26.000
Then after that...

34:26.000 --> 34:27.070
Kill what?

34:27.639 --> 34:28.800
If we fight,

34:28.800 --> 34:30.260
there will be casualties.

34:30.920 --> 34:32.300
My Lord is indeed amazing,

34:32.300 --> 34:33.070
but he is a lord

34:33.070 --> 34:34.929
who truly cares about the demons.

34:35.070 --> 34:35.949
He would hope

34:36.070 --> 34:38.929
to take back Demons' Valley
without any bloodshed.

34:39.190 --> 34:40.710
Although I don't quite understand,

34:40.710 --> 34:42.110
I think that makes sense.

34:42.150 --> 34:43.590
What should we do next?

34:45.480 --> 34:47.000
Let me check the situation.

34:47.000 --> 34:48.110
We can discuss it later

34:48.110 --> 34:49.610
after figuring out their formation.

34:49.610 --> 34:50.360
Take His Lordship

34:50.360 --> 34:51.889
and hide somewhere safe.

34:53.360 --> 34:54.000
Hide?

34:54.000 --> 34:54.510
Hide?

34:54.670 --> 34:55.190
Yes.

34:57.070 --> 34:58.110
Not hide.

34:58.110 --> 34:59.000
It's rest.

34:59.480 --> 35:00.920
My Lord has been working hard these days

35:00.920 --> 35:02.250
and needs to rest first.

35:02.510 --> 35:03.440
Just find a place

35:03.440 --> 35:05.170
where no one will discover you.

35:05.190 --> 35:07.030
But even I don't feel tired.

35:08.280 --> 35:10.190
You've been eating,
drinking, and sleeping the whole way,

35:10.190 --> 35:11.450
why would you be tired?

35:11.910 --> 35:12.640
That's true.

35:19.630 --> 35:21.290
I'll go ahead and wait for you.

35:22.550 --> 35:23.190
Xiao Yao.

35:23.760 --> 35:24.960
As the Demon Lord,

35:25.030 --> 35:26.630
I have my responsibilities.

35:27.320 --> 35:28.780
Though I've lost my power,

35:29.000 --> 35:31.460
no one knows Demons' Valley
better than I do.

35:31.510 --> 35:32.640
I don't want to hide.

35:33.000 --> 35:34.860
Besides, Heiwu fears me the most.

35:35.000 --> 35:37.230
The Feiyu Guard has been searching
for the Kunlun Mirror.

35:37.230 --> 35:38.710
As long as they want something,

35:38.710 --> 35:40.070
we can find a way

35:40.320 --> 35:41.720
to defeat them one by one.

35:42.360 --> 35:43.070
But...

35:46.880 --> 35:47.950
It's here!

35:50.840 --> 35:51.670
We're back!

35:51.880 --> 35:53.410
Let's go back and fight now!

35:53.800 --> 35:54.930
We'll kill them all—

35:58.110 --> 35:58.590
Oh no,

35:58.910 --> 36:00.840
today is the first day of the month.

36:06.550 --> 36:07.220
I...

36:07.800 --> 36:09.180
Mr. Wu Huan!

36:10.400 --> 36:11.730
Look, there's a donkey.

36:23.550 --> 36:24.070
Go!

36:46.290 --> 36:47.590
As a bamboo stick,

36:48.130 --> 36:50.390
you can't even escape in a bamboo forest.

36:50.850 --> 36:53.910
You deserve to be caught
and made into mats and baskets.

37:07.100 --> 37:07.750
Go ahead.

37:08.960 --> 37:09.990
Keep running.

37:13.230 --> 37:13.760
Stop!

37:17.670 --> 37:18.150
My Lord?

37:18.670 --> 37:19.220
My Lord!

37:19.630 --> 37:20.960
My Lord, you're finally back!

37:20.960 --> 37:21.730
My Lord!

37:21.920 --> 37:23.110
He wants to capture us

37:23.110 --> 37:25.040
and hand us over to the Feiyu Guard.

37:30.960 --> 37:32.700
Did you not die from poisoning?

37:35.990 --> 37:38.250
It was the Dreamshard Immortal who died.

37:38.800 --> 37:40.200
Why should I fear poison?

37:41.960 --> 37:43.720
You previously framed Xiao Yao

37:43.750 --> 37:46.110
and led the Feiyu Guard
to massacre Demons' Valley.

37:46.110 --> 37:47.770
I was too busy to kill you then,

37:47.920 --> 37:51.050
which allowed you to harm your own kind
with Heiwu today.

37:51.730 --> 37:53.530
This is truly a capital offense.

37:54.290 --> 37:55.800
Go back and tell Heiwu.

37:56.110 --> 37:58.640
I never wished
to see our kind harm each other.

37:58.810 --> 38:00.210
I'll give him one chance.

38:00.950 --> 38:02.680
Release our kind immediately,

38:02.840 --> 38:03.920
leave Youning Cave,

38:03.920 --> 38:05.110
and get out of Demons' Valley.

38:05.110 --> 38:06.900
But if he dares to persist in his folly,

38:06.900 --> 38:09.080
I will show no more mercy.

38:09.510 --> 38:11.460
I will make sure your evil deeds

38:12.190 --> 38:14.710
are paid back a thousandfold.

38:24.000 --> 38:24.840
Wu Huan.

38:26.840 --> 38:28.100
The count is off today.

38:28.400 --> 38:29.320
These few minor demons

38:29.320 --> 38:30.400
are far from enough.

38:30.400 --> 38:33.460
Are you underestimating
the Feiyu Guard's abilities?

38:34.550 --> 38:35.410
There are more.

38:36.150 --> 38:37.280
They're all behind.

38:37.320 --> 38:37.710
Go.

38:44.550 --> 38:46.680
That looks like the Demon King Hong Ye.

38:52.510 --> 38:53.550
Are you sure?

38:54.190 --> 38:55.320
Are you certain it's the Demon King?

38:55.320 --> 38:55.710
Yes.

38:56.320 --> 38:57.710
I've seen him before

38:57.710 --> 38:59.310
when I raided Demons' Valley

38:59.360 --> 39:00.620
with the Demon Slayer.

39:09.800 --> 39:10.360
Luoluo.

39:10.630 --> 39:11.230
Bamboo.

39:11.840 --> 39:13.360
Are they the ones who have been
coming to Demons' Valley

39:13.360 --> 39:14.420
to capture demons?

39:14.670 --> 39:15.330
-Yes!
-Yes!

39:16.670 --> 39:17.360
Very well.

39:17.840 --> 39:19.500
With My Lord here today,

39:19.840 --> 39:22.900
are you going to make them
pay for their crimes in blood?

39:23.510 --> 39:25.040
I'll count to three.

39:25.190 --> 39:26.960
If I can still see you then,

39:27.070 --> 39:29.460
you'll have only your bad luck to blame.

39:30.550 --> 39:31.070
Three.

39:31.600 --> 39:32.110
Go!

39:37.720 --> 39:38.560
Two.

39:38.630 --> 39:39.230
Go.

39:46.280 --> 39:46.670
Run!

39:47.000 --> 39:48.160
Run! Hurry!

39:48.240 --> 39:49.600
W-Why?

39:49.840 --> 39:50.840
Hong Ye, let's go.

39:55.230 --> 39:55.880
Captain!

39:57.920 --> 39:58.630
Captain.

39:58.880 --> 39:59.630
Why are we running?

39:59.630 --> 40:01.590
Don't be stupid. You said it yourself.

40:01.590 --> 40:02.850
That's the Demon King.

40:02.850 --> 40:04.110
But he didn't chase us.

40:04.710 --> 40:06.150
Last time we saw him, he was formidable.

40:06.150 --> 40:07.110
Flying through the sky,
burrowing underground,

40:07.110 --> 40:08.400
killing anyone in his way.

40:08.400 --> 40:09.630
But just now he seemed

40:09.650 --> 40:11.020
somehow different.

40:11.710 --> 40:12.780
He was all talk.

40:13.880 --> 40:15.540
He didn't use his power at all.

40:15.960 --> 40:17.020
If that's the case,

40:18.190 --> 40:19.500
his power might be...

40:20.320 --> 40:20.960
Gone.

40:21.190 --> 40:22.550
This is our chance
to defeat the Demon King

40:22.550 --> 40:24.140
and achieve great merit!

40:25.070 --> 40:26.440
What kind of hunter runs away

40:26.440 --> 40:27.800
after spotting his prey?

40:27.800 --> 40:28.600
Let's go back!

40:29.030 --> 40:31.030
Let's see what powers he really has.

40:32.190 --> 40:32.720
Let's go!

40:33.760 --> 40:34.070
Go!

40:34.070 --> 40:34.440
Move!

40:34.440 --> 40:34.730
Go!

40:34.760 --> 40:35.130
Move!

40:35.160 --> 40:35.690
Let's go!

40:36.480 --> 40:37.480
W-Wait.

40:38.030 --> 40:39.360
W-Why are we running?

40:39.480 --> 40:40.840
Didn't His Lordship say
when he counts to three, we would...

40:40.840 --> 40:41.970
Take our revenge?

40:42.030 --> 40:42.510
Yeah.

40:42.670 --> 40:43.200
Xiao Yao.

40:43.440 --> 40:44.700
Take Bamboo and Luoluo

40:44.880 --> 40:45.670
and leave first.

40:45.670 --> 40:46.870
I'll deal with Wu Huan.

40:46.870 --> 40:47.420
Wait!

40:49.280 --> 40:50.010
Don't worry.

40:50.070 --> 40:51.440
I have a way to lure him away.

40:51.440 --> 40:52.100
Go quickly.

40:52.590 --> 40:53.110
No.

40:53.190 --> 40:54.320
This is the only way.

40:54.550 --> 40:55.480
Otherwise all of us

40:55.480 --> 40:56.530
will be trapped here.

40:56.530 --> 40:57.590
You still can't go.

40:58.630 --> 40:59.360
I have a plan

40:59.510 --> 41:00.320
that can both repel the enemy

41:00.320 --> 41:01.730
and keep everyone safe.

41:06.440 --> 41:07.440
He's gone indeed.

41:10.380 --> 41:12.190
He must've gotten injured when fighting

41:12.190 --> 41:13.650
the Dreamshard Immortal,

41:13.820 --> 41:15.480
which depleted all his power.

41:16.010 --> 41:17.630
Everyone spread out and search carefully.

41:17.630 --> 41:18.440
Capturing the Demon King

41:18.440 --> 41:20.510
brings far greater merit
than catching thousands of minor demons.

41:20.510 --> 41:21.030
Go now!

41:21.110 --> 41:21.670
Yes!
